                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Richardson,
                        Acting Secretary of the Treasury, to Mr. Robb</hi>.</head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg>
                </opener>
                <dateline><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps">Treasury Department</hi>,<lb/><hi
                            rendition="#italic">Washington</hi></placeName>, <date
                        calendar="gregorian" when="1869-09-03"><hi rendition="#italic"
                            >September</hi> 3, 1869</date>.</dateline>
                <p rendition="#flush"><hi rendition="#small-caps">Thos. P. Robb</hi>,<lb/><hi
                        rendition="#italic">Collector of Customs, Savannah, Georgia:</hi></p>
                <p>Put steamer McCulloch at command of proper authorities to stop expedition fitting
                    out for Cuba.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>WM. A. RICHARDSON,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic">Acting
                        Secretary.</hi></signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
